              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AmyGirl"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These are awesome!! I had these back in the 80's when I was stationed in Bermuda. Feel free to substitute walnuts for the almonds, apricots for the dates, I've even used smoked oysters and sliced water chestnuts wrapped with the bacon ... limitless combinations."
          },
