            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CaringLemon3859"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have been making these for years since Joan Rivers made them on Martha Stewart's show - HOWEVER, her recipe called for stuffing the dates with blue cheese (like a good stilton) instead of an almond. And OMG are they delicious! I will try dipping them in your sauce this Holiday season though. Thank you!",
            "datePublished": "2024-11-25T22:00:42.370Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
