            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KAREN WANG"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These were pretty good. Next time I’ll not use the brown sugar, and instead will use maple bacon so it’s not as sweet. Also, will use low sodium soy sauce since there’s plenty of sodium in the bacon.",
            "datePublished": "2020-03-24T02:48:11.950Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
