            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BriskSyrup8070"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These are always a great appetizer to have or bring to a party. I have also used water chestnuts in place of almonds. One time I was out of bacon and used Italian bacon. Worked out well.",
            "datePublished": "2022-11-05T16:03:38.403Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
