            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "allison"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have made this recipe several times and it has always been a hit. Because the dates are sweet, I like to add Sonoma Jack habanero cheese. My store was out, so I have mixed camembert cheese with some habanero pepper and made a paste. The hard cheese usually works out well, so I'll have to see if a soft cheese works as well. Someone else suggested blue cheese, which I think would also be wonderful.",
            "datePublished": "2012-03-21T19:57:15.680Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
